# The context of every image built from the repo root: the apps that prune the
# Bun workspace, images/mate-sandbox, which compiles packages/mate-hands, and
# images/tink-agent-autoid, which builds apps/fleetd's client beside its entry.sh.
# Ship just those trees, and the agent profile that apps/mate bakes; everything
# else (k8s, terraform, nix, .git, build output) stays out of context.
*
!apps
!packages
!package.json
!bun.lock
!turbo.json
!AGENTS.md
!.agents/skills
!images/mate-sandbox/gh
!images/mate-sandbox/kthx
!images/mate-sandbox/mise.toml
!images/tink-agent-autoid/entry.sh

# Even within the whitelisted trees, never send dependency/build artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.cache
**/*.log
